# fastlane match: ONE Apple Distribution certificate and an App Store profile per
# bundle ID (and platform), encrypted in a private git repo, the "vault". Every
# machine (your Mac, the runner, a fresh clone) signs from the same identity,
# fetched into a throwaway keychain, with no dependence on anyone's login
# keychain. Several apps on one team should SHARE one vault and one certificate:
# Apple allows only two or three Distribution certificates per team.
#
# MATCH_GIT_URL names the vault (an env var / Actions secret, so its location
# stays out of the source tree) and MATCH_PASSWORD decrypts it.
#
# No app_identifier here: the Fastfile's SIGNING table passes each platform's
# bundle IDs, so always run match through the lanes (`fastlane ios certificates`),
# never bare `fastlane match`.
git_url(ENV.fetch("MATCH_GIT_URL", ""))
storage_mode("git")
type("appstore")
team_id(ENV.fetch("TEAM_ID", "{{TEAM_ID}}"))
